w: 1.~Ah, ho- ly Je- sus, how hast Thou of- fen- ded,
w: 2.~Who was the guil- ty? Who brought this up- on Thee?
w: 3.~Lo, the Good Shep- herd for the sheep is of- fered;
w: 4.~For me, kind Je- sus, was Thy in- car- na- tion,
w: 5.~There- fore, kind Je- sus, since I can- not pay Thee,
