w: That man to judge Thee hath in hate pre- ten- ded?
w: A- las, my trea- son, Je- sus, hath un- done Thee.
w: The slave hath sin- nèd, and the Son hath suf- fered;
w: Thy mor- tal sor- row, and Thy life’s o- bla- tion;
w: I do a- dore Thee, and will ev- er pray Thee,
