w: By foes de- ri- ded, by Thine own re- ject- ed,
w: ’Twas I, Lord, Je- sus, I it was de- nied Thee!
w: For man’s a- tone- ment, while he no- thing heed- eth,
w: Thy death of an- guish and Thy bit- ter pas- sion,
w: Think on Thy pi- ty and Thy love un- swer- ving,
